# C40 — Test Cases

Phase: P09 (re-cut, D059). Status: planned. Required predecessor: C39.

## Outcome

The screen matches its prototype board side by side at 1440×900 in light and dark with real core data, as the owner approved from the chunk's composites, and passes its gate at 8.

## The board

R2App `start=cases`. The frozen prototype under `docs/architecture/ui-v2/prototype/` is the specification; `docs/planning/p09-recut.md` states the bar.

## Regions to port

title row with "Load starter packs…" and "New case"; the explain banner (860px); one table card with columns 1.6fr 1.2fr 2.2fr 176px 190px (name, product, input, result pill, action and ⋯ menu); the packs and new-case dialogs (560px) and the detail sheet (520px); the C33 behaviour (results, packs, Runtime-only Open in Playground, Inspect, import/export/copy) unchanged.

## Core it reads

`ShellSnapshot.library`; intents `openLibrary`, `saveCase`, `deleteCase`, `copyCase`, `importCases`, `exportCases`, `importExamples`, `scan` (named). No new core capability unless named here; v2 components import no legacy feature view.

## Parity

Composites at `docs/planning/evidence/C40/parity/<board>-<theme>.png` (prototype left, app right) with `notes.md` listing accessibility deviations; the owner's approval is recorded there before the gate.

## Gate

Rebuild, native acceptance (C40-N01 table, banner, dialogs; C40-N02 keyboard, ring, 900×600 at 200% both themes), the full desktop-core fixture suite and the Codex review; accepted at 8 (D032/D034), raised to 9 in C44.

## Tests

`ui_v2_cases` (the C33 `ui_v2_workbench` library tests move or stay registered); Vitest `v2/workbench/test-cases.test.tsx`.
